---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="ISHARA">
<h1>Safety and Reliability</h1>
<p><strong>Capture:</strong> gestures are ignored until you unlock with a deliberate fist hold.<br>
        <strong>Lock state:</strong> each gesture must be held briefly, so unclear or passing movements trigger nothing.
        <br><strong>Hold-to-trigger:</strong> the app determines which gesture the hand is making.
        <br><strong>Easy re-lock:</strong> hold a fist again whenever you want to gesture freely.
</p>
<p>Light your hand well. Even, front-facing light helps detection. Avoid strong backlighting such as a window behind you.<br>
Keep your hand in frame. Raise it in clear view of the camera, with a plain background where possible.
<br>Hold, don’t flick. Make each gesture clearly and keep it steady for a moment.
<br>Keep the slideshow focused. If another window has focus, keystrokes go there instead.
<br>Lock when idle. Lock between uses to avoid accidental triggers.
<br>Have a backup. Keep a keyboard or clicker nearby for critical presentations.</p>
</Layout>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: 34px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .post-list {
    list-style: none;
  }

  .post-list li {
    padding: 24px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .post-list a {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .post-title {
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .post-title:hover {
    color: var(--link);
  }

  .post-date {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-left: 16px;
  }

  .post-excerpt {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .empty {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
</style>